the methods that summarize it. \code{\link[=plot.bef_fit_re]{plot.bef_fit_re()}},
\code{\link[=predict.bef_fit_re]{predict.bef_fit_re()}}, \code{\link[=diagnose]{diagnose()}} and \code{\link[=loo.bef_fit]{loo.bef_fit()}} have pages of
